    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging subject for me, though I appreciate its logical structure. As someone with a PhD in literature and philosophy, I see it as a tool rather than a passion. It’s useful in problem-solving but not something I engage with daily or deeply. My background leans more toward abstract thinking, which sometimes clashes with the precision required in math.",
